==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*6 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Maji Cat & Cat Tour Group (Enemy)|Maji Cat & Cat Tour Group]] spawns as the boss after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Very easy stage, fast units like [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cat]] can easily beat this stage.

